WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.300 line:-2
<v Rep. Maxine Waters>Waters: Mr. Vice President, I rise to object

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.600 line:-2
<v Rep. Maxine Waters>to the fraudulent 25 Florida electoral votes.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.000 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>Gore: Is the objection in writing

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.200 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>and signed by a member of the House and a senator?

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.500 line:-2
<v Rep. Maxine Waters>Waters: The objection is in writing, and I don’t care

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.900 line:-2
<v Rep. Maxine Waters>that it is not signed by a member of the Senate.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.000 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>Gore: The chair will advise that the rules do care.

8
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.200 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>Gore, later: George W. Bush of the state of Texas has received

9
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.600 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>for president of the United States 271 votes.

10
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.400 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>Al Gore of the state of Tennessee has received 266 votes.

11
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.400 line:-2
[Applause]

12
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.100 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>May God bless our new president and our new vice president,

13
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.600 line:-2
<v Vice President Al Gore>and may God bless the United States of America.
